#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/sizers/flexgridsizer_wrapper.cpp:17
#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/sizers/grid_bag_sizer_wrapper.cpp:14
#: wxcrafter/wxCrafterCommon/sizers/grid_sizer_wrapper.cpp:14
msgid "The horizontal gap between grid cells"
